BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 750 Td (Warranty) Tj T* () Tj T* (The panels are covered for manufacturing defects for 25 years from the date of purchase.) Tj T* (The inverter has a separate 10 year warranty.) Tj T* (Damage from storms, hail, lightning or incorrect installation is not covered.) Tj T* (To make a claim, send the serial number and a photo of the damage to the seller.) Tj ET
