BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 750 Td (Inverter) Tj T* () Tj T* (The inverter changes direct current from the panels into alternating current) Tj T* (that household appliances can use. A typical inverter lasts 10 to 15 years.) Tj T* (A green light means normal operation. A red light means a fault: switch the inverter) Tj T* (off, wait 5 minutes and switch it on again. If the light stays red, call an electrician.) Tj ET
