BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 750 Td (Cleaning and maintenance) Tj T* () Tj T* (Clean the panels twice a year with plain water and a soft brush.) Tj T* (Do not use pressure washers because they can crack the glass.) Tj T* (Check the cables for damage once a year.) Tj T* (Output can drop by up to 20 percent when panels are very dusty.) Tj ET
